@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/folders/{folder_uuid}
actor "Клиент" as Client
participant "Контроллер RestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nFOLDER + USER_FOLDER_BINDING" as DB
queue "Транзакционный outbox" as OUT
queue "Типизированная задача проекции" as TASK
participant "Пул воркеров" as WORKER
database "Хранилище публичных событий" as EVENT
participant "Диспетчер WebSocket" as DISP
participant "Подписанный клиент" as WS
Client -> API: PUT JSON папки
note right of API
  Системные правило/тип вручную не меняются.
  Автоматические FOLDER_ITEM: активная USER_STREAM_BINDING + каноническая STREAM.is_archived = false.
  All chats = все; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false.
end note
API -> DB: BEGIN; заблокировать папку в заданной области
API -> DB: обновить каноническую FOLDER
API -> OUT: добавить folder.updated
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 200 JSON папки
OUT -> TASK: immutable folder_projection(outbox_event_uuid)\nscope=user-folder; без coalescing
TASK -> WORKER: claim user-folder(project,user,folder)\nlease + fencing
WORKER -> DB: прочитать ready snapshot/counts
group одна worker DB transaction
  WORKER -> DB: preserve ready snapshot/counts; idempotent effect guard
  WORKER -> EVENT: ready folder.updated
end
DISP -> EVENT: читать/повторять/воспроизводить
DISP -> WS: folder.updated
@enduml
